---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="만화원 이케부쿠로점 — 이케부쿠로 한국 BBQ 레스토랑"
  description="희귀 부위와 55가지 무한리필 코스. 이케부쿠로역에서 도보 2분. 개인실 완비."
  activePage="lp"
  lang="ko"
>
  <style>
    .hero { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 6rem 1.5rem 3rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background-color: var(--black); }
    .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
    .hero-bg-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.3; }
    .hero-bg-gradient { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(0deg,#000,transparent 19.17%); }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; max-width: 700px; }
    .hero-eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: 100px; padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .hero h1 { font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif; font-size: clamp(2.8rem,9vw,5.5rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
    .hero-tagline { font-size: clamp(1rem,2.8vw,1.35rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .hero-tagline span { color: var(--orange); }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .btn-primary { background-color: var(--orange); color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem; border-radius: 10px; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
    .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.75; }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; padding: 0.9rem 2rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
    .hero-stats { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-stat { text-align: center; }
    .hero-stat-num { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--orange); }
    .hero-stat-label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .ai-banner { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); padding: 1rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
    .ai-banner-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .ai-chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: 100px; padding: 0.22rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.72rem; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--white); }
    .ai-chip .dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #27ae60; display: inline-block; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
    section { padding: 60px 1.5rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-label { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--orange); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.2rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.3; }
    .section-subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 600px; }
    .image-section { margin-top: 48px; overflow: hidden; }
    .image-scroll { display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 1rem; scrollbar-width: none; }
    .image-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .image-scroll-item { flex: 0 0 240px; height: 160px; border-radius: 8px; background-color: #1a1a1a; overflow: hidden; }
    .image-scroll-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.3s; }
    .image-scroll-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }
    @media screen and (min-width: 768px) { .image-scroll-item { flex: 0 0 320px; height: 200px; } }
    .image-scroll-caption { text-align: center; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .image-scroll-caption a { color: var(--orange); text-decoration: none; }
    .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .menu-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; transition: all 0.25s; }
    .menu-card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .menu-card-img { width: 100%; height: 180px; background: #1a1a1a; overflow: hidden; }
    .menu-card-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.3s; }
    .menu-card-body { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .menu-card-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.65rem; background: rgba(247,151,11,0.18); color: var(--orange); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .menu-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .menu-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .features-section { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); padding: 60px 1.5rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
    .features-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .feature-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.75rem; transition: all 0.25s; }
    .feature-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .feature-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .reviews-section { padding: 60px 1.5rem; }
    .reviews-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .retty-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#e74c3c,#c0392b); color: var(--white); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .reviews-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(270px,1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .review-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; }
    .review-stars { color: var(--orange); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .review-text { font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .review-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .review-avatar { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#e74c3c,#c0392b); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); }
    .review-name { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
    .review-meta { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .info-section { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); padding: 60px 1.5rem; }
    .info-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .info-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; } }
    .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .info-table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); }
    .info-table td { padding: 0.75rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; vertical-align: top; }
    .info-table td:first-child { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 600; width: 7rem; white-space: nowrap; }
    .info-table td:last-child { color: var(--text-muted); }
    .map-placeholder { background: #1a1a1a; border-radius: 8px; height: 250px; border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .map-placeholder .map-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .map-placeholder strong { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .map-placeholder span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .reserve-section { padding: 60px 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .reserve-inner { max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .reserve-cta-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; }
    .btn-reserve-main { background-color: var(--orange); color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; height: 60px; border-radius: 10px; border: none; width: 100%; max-width: 400px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
    .btn-reserve-main:hover { opacity: 0.75; }
    .reserve-tel { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .reserve-tel small { display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .line-chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: var(--green); color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; border-radius: 50px; padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.2s; text-decoration: none; }
    .line-chip:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
    .os-banner { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem; margin: 0 auto 60px; max-width: 700px; text-align: center; }
    .os-banner-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .os-banner p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .os-features { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .os-feature-chip { background: rgba(247,151,11,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(247,151,11,0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--orange); }
    @keyframes fadeUp { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }
    .hero-content > * { animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both; }
    .blog-cta-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: rgba(231,76,60,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(231,76,60,0.4); color: #e74c3c; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .blog-cta-btn:hover { background: rgba(231,76,60,0.25); }
  </style>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <img class="hero-bg-img" src="https://img.retty.me/img_ebisu/restaurant/100001705704/archive/3520904-67ad5f166a029.jpg" alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" />
      <div class="hero-bg-gradient"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Retty 레스토랑 OS — 데모 페이지</div>
      <h1>萬和苑</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">한국 BBQ / 이케부쿠로</p>
      <p class="hero-tagline">희귀 부위와 국산 와규, <span>55가지 무한리필</span> 극상의 경험</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#reserve" class="btn-primary">지금 예약 →</a>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn-secondary">메뉴 보기</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hero-stat"><div class="hero-stat-num">55가지</div><div class="hero-stat-label">무한리필 메뉴</div></div>
        <div class="hero-stat"><div class="hero-stat-num">70석</div><div class="hero-stat-label">개인실·카운터 완비</div></div>
        <div class="hero-stat"><div class="hero-stat-num">도보 2분</div><div class="hero-stat-label">이케부쿠로역에서</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-banner">
    <div class="ai-banner-inner">
      <span>이 페이지는 레스토랑 OS에 의해</span>
      <span class="ai-chip"><span class="dot"></span>AI가 상시 업데이트 중</span>
      <span class="ai-chip">LINE 연동</span>
      <span class="ai-chip">다국어 대응</span>
      <span class="ai-chip">예약 일원 관리</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="image-section">
    <div class="image-scroll">
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-01.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-02.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-03.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-04.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-05.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-06.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-07.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="image-scroll-item"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-08.jpg`} alt="만화원 이케부쿠로점" loading="lazy" /></div>
    </div>
    <p class="image-scroll-caption">사진 제공: <a href="https://retty.me/area/PRE13/ARE662/SUB66202/100001705704/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Retty — 만화원 이케부쿠로점</a></p>
  </div>

  <section id="menu">
    <p class="section-label">Our Menu</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">고객이 선택한 인기 메뉴</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">희귀 부위 비교 시식, 55가지 무한리필 — 고객의 목소리로 완성된 메뉴 라인업.</p>
    <div class="menu-grid">
      <div class="menu-card"><div class="menu-card-img"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-01.jpg`} alt="갈비 / 하라미" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="menu-card-body"><span class="menu-card-tag">희귀 부위</span><h3>갈비 / 하라미</h3><p>"부위의 차이가 선명하게 느껴진다" — 고객들이 국산 와규 희귀 부위의 개성을 발견하는 식사.</p></div></div>
      <div class="menu-card"><div class="menu-card-img"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-03.jpg`} alt="무한리필 코스" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="menu-card-body"><span class="menu-card-tag">무한리필 55품</span><h3>무한리필 코스</h3><p>"이 가격에 이 퀄리티" — 고객이 반복적으로 극찬하는 55가지 무한리필 코스.</p></div></div>
      <div class="menu-card"><div class="menu-card-img"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-05.jpg`} alt="무제한 음주" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="menu-card-body"><span class="menu-card-tag">단품 음료 무한리필</span><h3>2시간 무제한 음주</h3><p>1,815엔~(세금 포함). 생맥주·추하이·막걸리 등 풍성한 라인업.</p></div></div>
      <div class="menu-card"><div class="menu-card-img"><img src={`${base}/images/retty/photo-07.jpg`} alt="한국 정통 메뉴" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="menu-card-body"><span class="menu-card-tag">한국 정통</span><h3>찌개 / 나물</h3><p>고객들로부터 "본고장 맛"이라는 극찬을 받는 사이드 메뉴. 마무리는 국밥·비빔밥.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="features-section">
    <div class="features-inner">
      <p class="section-label">Restaurant OS</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">고객의 경험을 더 많은 분들께 전달하기 위해</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Retty의 레스토랑 OS를 도입하면, 고객의 목소리를 기반으로 한 이런 사이트를 AI가 자동 생성·상시 업데이트합니다.</p>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🤖</div><h3>AI가 항상 최신 정보로 유지</h3><p>메뉴 변경·시즌 한정·이벤트 정보를 LINE으로 보내기만 하면 AI가 즉시 업데이트.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">📱</div><h3>LINE 연동으로 즉시 반영</h3><p>직원들이 익숙한 LINE으로 정보 발신. IT 기술 불필요, 30초면 페이지가 업데이트됩니다.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🌍</div><h3>자동 다국어 대응</h3><p>일본어로 입력한 내용을 영어·중국어·한국어 등으로 자동 번역. 인바운드 고객도 놓치지 않습니다.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">📊</div><h3>예약·리뷰 일원 관리</h3><p>Retty의 실명 리뷰와 예약 데이터를 통합. 집객~방문~재방문까지 OS가 지원합니다.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">⭐</div><h3>Retty 탑 유저 연동</h3><p>실명 리뷰를 가진 Retty 탑 유저의 목소리를 자동 게재. 신뢰성이 크게 향상됩니다.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">📈</div><h3>데이터로 경영 판단</h3><p>페이지뷰·예약 전환율·리뷰 평가 트렌드를 대시보드에서 실시간 파악.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="reviews-section">
    <div class="reviews-inner">
      <p class="section-label">고객 리뷰</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">고객이 말하는 만화원에서의 경험</h2>
      <div class="retty-badge">★ Retty 탑 유저 실명 리뷰</div>
      <div class="reviews-grid">
        <div class="review-card"><div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="review-text">"이케부쿠로에서 이렇게 가성비 좋은 야키니쿠를 먹을 수 있다니 놀랐습니다. 희귀 부위가 무한리필에 포함되어 있어서 너무 행복했어요. 개인실도 있어서 접대용으로도 완벽합니다."</p><div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">T</div><div><div class="review-name">Takeshi M.</div><div class="review-meta">Retty 탑 유저 · 2026년 5월</div></div></div></div>
